sma`\n- The commands: `prisma orm init --yes`, `prisma contract emit`, `prisma db init`\n- The query syntax: `db.orm.public.User.create()`, `include('posts')`, `db.close()`\n- The `--yes` flag to avoid interactive prompts"}],"source":"harness","userDisplayContent":null,"outcome":{"type":"committed"}}
